{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 2903431659846253946,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Debugging I/O Hangs",
      "source_hash": 12446036932139635026,
      "context_hash": 11744534139640713656,
      "translation": "I/O hang 디버깅",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101654Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "When I/O is not just slow but completely stuck — how to identify, triage, and recover from I/O hangs in Linux",
      "source_hash": 16496495954968761402,
      "context_hash": 522590931970022991,
      "translation": "I/O가 단순히 느린 것이 아니라 완전히 멈췄을 때 — Linux에서 I/O hang을 식별하고, 분류하고, 복구하는 방법",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Linux": "Linux"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101655Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is an I/O hang?",
      "source_hash": 1919372111346396507,
      "context_hash": 18332173619706014602,
      "translation": "I/O hang이란 무엇입니까?",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101655Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A process in **D state** (uninterruptible sleep) is waiting for I/O to complete.",
      "source_hash": 17458148392862004132,
      "context_hash": 10451940794327414701,
      "translation": "**D 상태**(uninterruptible sleep)인 프로세스는 I/O가 완료되기를 기다리고 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101655Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "Normally this lasts microseconds to milliseconds.",
      "source_hash": 15497875634270790429,
      "context_hash": 11076388731876266923,
      "translation": "일반적으로 이 상태는 수 마이크로초에서 수 밀리초 동안 지속됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:2",
      "source": "An I/O hang occurs when a process stays in D state for seconds, minutes, or indefinitely — typically because:",
      "source_hash": 12644987230538782064,
      "context_hash": 8681233780356068418,
      "translation": "I/O hang은 프로세스가 수 초, 수 분 또는 무기한으로 D 상태에 머무를 때 발생하며, 그 원인은 일반적으로 다음과 같습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101656Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "A storage device stopped responding (hardware failure, firmware hang, cable issue)",
      "source_hash": 15050869947455835261,
      "context_hash": 6824498820842894969,
      "translation": "스토리지 디바이스가 응답을 멈춘 경우(하드웨어 장애, 펌웨어 hang, 케이블 문제)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "firmware": "펌웨어"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478610Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "A network filesystem (NFS, CIFS) lost its server connection",
      "source_hash": 18144043632752863744,
      "context_hash": 14108153898077885345,
      "translation": "네트워크 파일시스템(NFS, CIFS)의 서버 연결 끊김",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The block layer detected an error and is retrying without limit",
      "source_hash": 15108583210225044572,
      "context_hash": 11284523110162924792,
      "translation": "오류를 감지한 블록 계층의 무제한 재시도",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "block layer": "블록 계층"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101657Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "A kernel lock is held by a D-state process, causing a chain of dependents",
      "source_hash": 15356501660857799673,
      "context_hash": 8569442640912029078,
      "translation": "D 상태 프로세스가 보유한 커널 락으로 인한 의존 프로세스들의 연쇄 대기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:6/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel logs a \"hung task\" warning after 120 seconds by default:",
      "source_hash": 1942162034564471351,
      "context_hash": 2911588802966406143,
      "translation": "커널은 기본적으로 120초가 지나면 \"hung task\" 경고를 기록합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 1: Identify which processes are hung",
      "source_hash": 4371097985695681404,
      "context_hash": 7529801755962148396,
      "translation": "1단계: hang 상태인 프로세스 식별",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101658Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
