    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 2: Get the full kernel stack",
      "source_hash": 7659697266361162044,
      "context_hash": 1103615515155918620,
      "translation": "2단계: 전체 커널 스택 확인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel stack": "커널 스택"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101660Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "The stack trace tells you exactly where in the kernel the process is blocked.",
      "source_hash": 16504003643216950371,
      "context_hash": 2526116981956999238,
      "translation": "스택 트레이스는 프로세스가 커널의 정확히 어느 지점에서 블록되어 있는지 알려 줍니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:2/seg:1",
      "source": "Work upward from the innermost frame.",
      "source_hash": 11104094587786358006,
      "context_hash": 14701468864989764335,
      "translation": "가장 안쪽 프레임에서부터 위쪽으로 거슬러 올라가며 분석하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:34:49.101661Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Getting stacks for all D-state processes at once (useful during an incident):**",
      "source_hash": 8776783485153236474,
      "context_hash": 14458486687122421929,
      "translation": "**모든 D 상태 프로세스의 스택을 한 번에 얻기(장애 대응 중에 유용함):**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709359Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 3: Check device health",
      "source_hash": 9131540723229836193,
      "context_hash": 17594574548313540889,
      "translation": "3단계: 디바이스 상태 확인",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478613Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If processes are stuck in block I/O, check whether the device itself has stopped responding.",
      "source_hash": 9253547175993080854,
      "context_hash": 15975362353272035848,
      "translation": "프로세스가 block I/O에서 멈춰 있다면 디바이스 자체가 응답을 멈추었는지 확인하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478614Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Common device hang signatures in dmesg:**",
      "source_hash": 15973533511719167671,
      "context_hash": 12524834717210252830,
      "translation": "**dmesg에 나타나는 일반적인 디바이스 hang 징후:**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478615Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 4: Check for NFS hangs",
      "source_hash": 5477882917719142146,
      "context_hash": 11848663678076248562,
      "translation": "4단계: NFS hang 점검",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "NFS hangs are a common cause of D-state processes.",
      "source_hash": 2468532145088799501,
      "context_hash": 18244396877442476208,
      "translation": "NFS hang은 D 상태 프로세스의 흔한 원인입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "They occur when the NFS server becomes unreachable, or when the client's connection times out.",
      "source_hash": 3684806611816496434,
      "context_hash": 16580288371455833947,
      "translation": "NFS hang은 NFS 서버에 연결할 수 없게 되거나 클라이언트의 연결이 타임아웃될 때 발생합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Hard vs soft NFS mounts:**",
      "source_hash": 3852033656675075921,
      "context_hash": 15149581176674786841,
      "translation": "**hard NFS 마운트와 soft NFS 마운트 비교:**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709363Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "A mount with `hard` (the default) will retry indefinitely on server failure — processes will hang in D state until the server returns.",
      "source_hash": 1381639182949265181,
      "context_hash": 9740456116091221785,
      "translation": "`hard`(기본값)로 마운트하면 서버 장애 시 무한히 재시도하므로, 서버가 복구될 때까지 프로세스가 D 상태에서 멈춰 있게 됩니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709364Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "A `soft` mount will return `EIO` after `retrans` retries × `timeo` timeout.",
      "source_hash": 14177640919197077172,
      "context_hash": 8165985589011000206,
      "translation": "`soft` 마운트는 `retrans`회 재시도 × `timeo` 타임아웃이 지나면 `EIO`를 반환합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709364Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:7/seg:0",
      "source": "Data risk with force unmount",
      "source_hash": 18165909182809753858,
      "context_hash": 3278882145178628261,
      "translation": "강제 언마운트 시의 데이터 위험",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709365Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:0",
      "source": "Force-unmounting an NFS filesystem with dirty data may lose writes that have not yet reached the server.",
      "source_hash": 7370552378022988002,
      "context_hash": 8323512982376689463,
      "translation": "dirty 데이터가 있는 NFS 파일 시스템을 강제로 언마운트하면 아직 서버에 도달하지 않은 쓰기가 유실될 수 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709365Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:8/seg:1",
      "source": "Only use `-f` when you accept potential data loss and need to recover the system.",
      "source_hash": 2211655234865956273,
      "context_hash": 6718338359451513465,
      "translation": "데이터 유실 가능성을 감수하고 시스템을 복구해야 하는 경우에만 `-f`를 사용하십시오.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 5: Check for writeback hangs",
      "source_hash": 16460574156930879890,
      "context_hash": 11901005705277524753,
      "translation": "5단계: writeback hang 점검",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "A writeback hang occurs when dirty pages cannot be flushed: the flusher kworker is stuck, or the device is returning errors that cause retries.",
      "source_hash": 3507172744983424314,
      "context_hash": 1270621704241752590,
      "translation": "writeback hang은 dirty 페이지를 flush할 수 없을 때 발생합니다. 즉, flusher kworker가 멈춰 있거나 디바이스가 재시도를 유발하는 오류를 반환하고 있는 경우입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스",
        "dirty pages": "dirty 페이지",
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478615Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Force a writeback stall to resolve:**",
      "source_hash": 16076036664317044946,
      "context_hash": 16282266079474912056,
      "translation": "**writeback 지연을 강제로 해소하기:**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "writeback": "writeback"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709366Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 6: Check for lock contention causing hangs",
      "source_hash": 372840377167400957,
      "context_hash": 7797195955535692615,
      "translation": "6단계: hang을 일으키는 락 경합 점검",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "lock contention": "락 경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Sometimes a process appears to be doing I/O but is actually waiting for a kernel lock held by a D-state I/O waiter.",
      "source_hash": 5204790541694026343,
      "context_hash": 9114343939987683745,
      "translation": "프로세스가 I/O를 수행하는 것처럼 보이지만 실제로는 D 상태의 I/O 대기자가 보유한 커널 락을 기다리고 있는 경우가 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "This creates a chain of stuck processes.",
      "source_hash": 15267025998401727834,
      "context_hash": 11506105791879376171,
      "translation": "이로 인해 멈춘 프로세스들이 연쇄적으로 이어집니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "processes": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "**Using `perf lock` to find lock contention:**",
      "source_hash": 2986440776180332264,
      "context_hash": 5932413927550062268,
      "translation": "**`perf lock`을 사용하여 락 경합 찾기:**",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "lock contention": "락 경합"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:02:50.709367Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Step 7: Recover from a device hang without rebooting",
      "source_hash": 16836831539283816015,
      "context_hash": 2141728361691636414,
      "translation": "7단계: 재부팅 없이 디바이스 hang에서 복구",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478616Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If a single device has hung but the system is otherwise functional, you may be able to reset the device without rebooting.",
      "source_hash": 9734796291846091890,
      "context_hash": 6128446330898024765,
      "translation": "단일 디바이스가 hang 상태이지만 시스템의 나머지 부분은 정상적으로 동작한다면, 재부팅하지 않고 디바이스를 리셋할 수 있을 수도 있습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "device": "디바이스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:28:49.478616Z",
      "issues": []
    },
